<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Shakarparian Islamabad Guide"
  description="Privacy policy of the Shakarparian Islamabad Guide website: analytics, cookies, and your rights."
  noHeader
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container"><small>Legal</small><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div>
  </section>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <div class="backlink"><a href="/en/">← Back to Shakarparian Guide</a></div>
    <article class="legal-body">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>This privacy policy applies to the Shakarparian Islamabad Guide website (hereafter “the website” or “we”). This website is an independent, non-profit tourism information project and is not affiliated with any government body.</p>

      <h2>What data we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> With your consent, we use privacy-friendly analytics that record only anonymous, aggregate page views and approximate country/device. We do not merge this with personal profiles.</li>
        <li><strong>Personal data:</strong> We do not collect names, emails, or payment details through the site itself, except where you voluntarily contact us.</li>
        <li><strong>No selling:</strong> We do not sell or share personal data with advertisers or third parties.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use a minimal cookie consent. Essential cookies are needed for basic operation; analytics cookies are loaded only after you allow them. You can change your choice anytime from the cookie settings link in the footer.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your region, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete your data, and to object to processing. To exercise these rights, contact us using the address below. For EU/UK visitors, applicable data-protection law (e.g., GDPR) applies; for Pakistan, the relevant protections (e.g., PECA) apply.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For any privacy question, write to <a href="mailto:shakarparian.guide@gmail.com">shakarparian.guide@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
